  "title": "Quick and Easy Vegetable Curry",
  "description": "This one-pot vegetable curry with onion, garlic, tomatoes, mixed vegetables and warm spices comes together quickly for an easy vegetarian meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Michelle Young"
  ],
